+# RIGGING
+
+## Project
+
+TodoMVC shakedown. Vanilla JS, no preprocessors. DOM-level behaviour verification with Cucumber and happy-dom.
+
+## Stack
+
+- Runtime: Node.js
+- Test runner: Cucumber (cucumber-js)
+- DOM simulation: happy-dom
+- Assertions: Node assert/strict
+
+## Directories
+
+- `features/`: Gherkin specifications
+- `features/support/`: step definitions and world setup
+- `js/`: production JavaScript
+- `index.html`: production markup
+- `css/`: production styles
+- `assets/`: human-owned product material
+
+## Methods
+
+- `verify`: `npx cucumber-js --tags "@watch<watch>"` or `npx cucumber-js`
+- `prove`: `npx cucumber-js`
+- `sweep`: `npx cucumber-js`
+- `static`: `node --check js/app.js`
+- `hygiene`: `npx cucumber-js`
+
+## Tiers
+
+- `@watch1` through `@watch10`: focused watch runs
